  "releaseNotes": "v1.20\n- Improve rendering performance by caching property accessors and streaming output.\n- Add TextWriter APIs for CSV, Markdown, HTML, SpecFlow, and SQL output.\n- Correct CSV quoting, HTML encoding, SQL escaping, and culture-independent SQL literals.\n- Improve DbTable support for one-shot and heterogeneous row sequences.\n- Continue supporting both .NET 8 and .NET 10.",
